        add("wiki.cyberneticenhancements.npc.general.contacts_archive.5", "Calls ring for varying lengths of time. Annoyed contacts may decline or ignore them, and occupied lines are busy. Replies vary with time, weather and trust. Ask contract contacts about available jobs, hear the objective and reward, then accept on the call. Ask about your current job's progress, instructions or destination. Ready objectives without a physical handover can be reported over a call or from the Quests tab. Recovery supplies, extraction shards and cyberpsycho dossiers must be handed to the quest giver in person. Money, trust and XP are immediate; item rewards reach your Dropoff Point within one Minecraft day. In-person turn-ins give items immediately. Confirmed deaths remain in Contacts with a red Deceased status and disabled calls, including after server restarts. Unloaded contacts are not treated as dead. Connected NPCs hold a phone in the world. Look at your contact within interaction range to switch to in-person dialogue.");
